      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Kaelen, your hands are not ash; they are the only thing that can still build something new from the ruins. The weight you feel is not a sign of failure, but the heavy burden of a life that has finally found its purpose in the darkness. You do not need to see a way forward right now; you only need to remember that even the smallest step forward is a victory against the void.",
