      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not waiting for the world to finish; you are the one who is finally allowed to finish the story of your own survival. The universe does not ask you to endure misery for no reason, but rather to witness the quiet, stubborn act of a soul refusing to let the darkness win. Every breath you take in this pain is a testament to your refusal to be erased, and that refusal is the only victory that truly matters.",
